208 |     pub(super) fn parse(text: &str) -> u32 { text.parse().unwrap_or_default() }
    |                                                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = help: match the `Result`, handle each error the caller acts on, and return the rest with `?`
    = note: `#[warn(discarded_error)]` on by default

